***REMOVED*** Next Watch - Architecture & Directory Structure

***REMOVED******REMOVED*** 🏗️ Architecture Principles

This project follows a **sophisticated layered architecture** with domain-driven design and atomic component organization.

***REMOVED******REMOVED******REMOVED*** Core Technology Stack

- **Next.js 15** with App Router (latest patterns)
- **TypeScript** with strict configuration
- **Chakra UI** as design system with semantic tokens
- **React Query** for server state management
- **Zustand** for client state management
- **pnpm** as package manager with **Turbo** for development

***REMOVED******REMOVED*** 📁 Directory Structure Rules

***REMOVED******REMOVED******REMOVED*** Mandatory Organization Pattern

```
src/
├── app/                    ***REMOVED*** Next.js App Router pages
├── components/             ***REMOVED*** Component library
│   ├── ui/                ***REMOVED*** Atomic Design components
│   │   ├── atoms/         ***REMOVED*** Basic building blocks
│   │   ├── molecules/     ***REMOVED*** Combined functionality
│   │   ├── organisms/     ***REMOVED*** Complex sections
│   │   └── templates/     ***REMOVED*** Page layouts
│   ├── features/          ***REMOVED*** Domain-specific components
│   │   ├── movies/        ***REMOVED*** Movie domain
│   │   ├── auth/          ***REMOVED*** Authentication
│   │   ├── profile/       ***REMOVED*** User profile
│   │   └── actors/        ***REMOVED*** Actor domain
│   └── mobile/            ***REMOVED*** Mobile-specific (legacy - being phased out)
├── hooks/                 ***REMOVED*** Organized by responsibility
│   ├── core/              ***REMOVED*** Auth, settings, route protection
│   ├── domain/            ***REMOVED*** Business logic hooks
│   ├── ui/                ***REMOVED*** Presentation utilities
│   ├── performance/       ***REMOVED*** Optimization hooks
│   ├── navigation/        ***REMOVED*** Routing utilities
│   └── filter/            ***REMOVED*** Data filtering and sorting
├── services/              ***REMOVED*** API layer
├── utils/                 ***REMOVED*** Utility functions
├── domain/                ***REMOVED*** Business entities
├── store/                 ***REMOVED*** State management
├── providers/             ***REMOVED*** Context providers
└── config/                ***REMOVED*** Configuration
```

***REMOVED******REMOVED******REMOVED*** File Organization Rules

1. **Feature-based organization** for domain logic
2. **Atomic-based organization** for UI components
3. **Barrel exports** (`index.ts`) for clean imports
4. **Co-located types** in `types.ts` files at appropriate levels

***REMOVED******REMOVED******REMOVED*** Domain Boundaries

- **Domain isolation**: Each feature domain (movies, auth, profile) is self-contained
- **Shared concerns**: Common UI components live in `ui/` directory
- **Cross-cutting**: Utilities and services are shared across domains
- **Clear interfaces**: Well-defined APIs between layers

